f, abs.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Hell.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 5, 13,</span> <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> <span class=\"ital\">avec le gén.</span> <span class=\"grec\">πορρωτέρω τοῦ\nδέοντος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">562</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span>, bien au-delà de ce qu’il faut, beaucoup plus\nqu’il ne faut ; <span class=\"grec\">πορρωτάτω τῶν ὑποψιῶν,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Isocr.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">34</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span>, très loin de tout\nsoupçon.</div>\n<div class=\"etymrev\"><span class=\"etiqetymrev\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">πόρσω</span>.</div>\n"}]}